  "metadata": {
    "title": "Quantization trades a little precision for smaller weights",
    "description": "Absmax quantization scales values, rounds to a small integer range, and dequantizes for use. FP32 to INT8 reduces storage fourfold with rounding error. A large outlier shrinks the scale and collapses small values to few levels; LLM.int8 handles outlier dimensions in FP16."
